FOOTNOTE 1: Authorized General Fund full time positions for FY2021 shall not exceed 382.
FOOTNOTE 2: Salaries of the 382 authorized General Fund positions, as well as salaries from all other
funds, shall not be increased in FY2021 through any type of raise, merit pay, cost of living adjustment, or
any other reason. This footnote excludes members of the Police Department and Fire Union who are
governed by separate compensation agreements. This footnote also excludes seasonal workers and does
not prohibit an employee from being promoted into a pre-existing higher position with a pre-existing
higher salary.
